    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Medical is a professional, user-friendly theme ideal for medical websites, hospitals, clinics, healthcare centers, nursing homes, medical shops, dentists, doctors, surgeons, physiotherapists, pediatricians, gynecologists, cardiologists, and other health-related institutions. Designed to build trust and highlight medical services, it features a prominent banner area, a team section to showcase healthcare professionals, and a blog section for sharing health tips, updates, or medical news. The theme offers easy customization with built-in options for layouts, colors, and styles without coding and ensures a responsive, fast-loading design for optimal performance on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. With one-click demo import, setting up hospital, clinic, dental, or pharmacy websites is quick and simple. Fully compatible with Contact Form 7 and Appointment Booking, it streamlines patient queries, online appointments, and medical consultations. Clean typography, intuitive navigation, SEO optimization, and accessibility make Flex Medical a lightweight yet powerful solution for doctors, hospitals, clinics, and healthcare professionals seeking a professional and functional online presence."
    },
